# Line endings are pinned so a file's worktree bytes do not depend on which
# tool wrote it last. Without this, core.autocrlf=true + an editor that writes
# LF makes git report files as modified while `git diff` is empty — on
# 2026-11-17 that showed up as 73 phantom "M" entries and forced a manual
# `git read-tree HEAD` to recover a trustworthy `git status`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
